{{- if eq .Trigger "Schedule" -}}
This is the Kiné's periodic review: look for recurrences across the period's incidents and follow the open actions.
{{- else if .Investigations -}}
Review the incident these investigations diagnosed, now that it is over.
{{- else -}}
Review the incidents of the period, as asked by hand.
{{- end }}

Review: {{ .Name }}
Scope: {{ .Scope }}
{{- if .Investigations }}
{{- if .Incident }}
Incident key: {{ .Incident }}
{{- end }}
Investigations under review, oldest first:
{{- range .Investigations }}
- {{ . }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
Period: from {{ .From }} to {{ .To }}

{{ if .Practitioner -}}
Your task: the problem, its recurrences and the earlier actions with their state, then the new corrective actions this incident calls for and a post-mortem draft.
{{- else -}}
Your task: the problem, its recurrences and the earlier actions still undone. You work as an Apprentice: no new action, no post-mortem.
{{- end }}

Read the records with your tools and answer as your instructions say: one fenced JSON block, no question.
